      "start_seconds": 446.74,
      "end_seconds": 448.52,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, definitely, I authorize that.",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0073",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 451.74,
      "end_seconds": 452.66,
      "text": "All right, give me a moment.",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0074",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 457.81,
      "end_seconds": 467.17,
      "text": "Okay, it's added. Your line should now show 7.2 gigabytes of high -speed data available for the rest of the cycle.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0075",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 469.52,
      "end_seconds": 475.62,
      "text": "Okay, okay, that's great. Can we just make sure it actually works before I hang up, just while I have you on the phone?",
      "word_count": 25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0076",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 476.86,
      "end_seconds": 478.0,
      "text": "Is there a way to test that?",
      "word_count": 7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0077",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 478.05,
      "end_seconds": 478.57,
      "text": "Absolutely,",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.52,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0078",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 480.84,
      "end_seconds": 484.92,
      "text": "go ahead and turn Wi -Fi on and then run a quick speed test.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0079",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 485.46,
      "end_seconds": 485.98,
      "text": "Mm -hmm.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.52,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0080",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 486.02,
      "end_seconds": 489.88,
      "text": "You don't need to stream a long video. We just need a small portion and test.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0081",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 491.95,
      "end_seconds": 492.99,
      "text": "Okay, yeah, one second.",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0082",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 497.96,
      "end_seconds": 506.22,
      "text": "Okay, I'm just running through like a quick speed test and it says 62 down and eight up.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0083",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 508.65,
      "end_seconds": 520.23,
      "text": "Okay, great. That confirms that cellular data is working normally. Now, I want you to open Streambox once with Wi -Fi still off and make sure it warns you instead of downloading.",
      "word_count": 32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0084",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 521.86,
      "end_seconds": 522.96,
      "text": "Okay, one second.",
      "word_count": 3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0085",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 527.33,
      "end_seconds": 531.89,
      "text": "Okay, yeah, I'm looking at it now. Yeah, it says say downloads or pause until wifi.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0086",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 533.81,
      "end_seconds": 536.59,
      "text": "Yeah, that's what I wanted in the first place. So that's great.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0087",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 540.39,
      "end_seconds": 545.01,
      "text": "Okay, perfect. So you can go ahead and turn Wi -Fi back on.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0088",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 545.4,
      "end_seconds": 545.84,
      "text": "Yeah,",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.44,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0089",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 545.64,
      "end_seconds": 557.92,
      "text": "And the final state is that Streambox is gonna be set to Wi -Fi only. Make sure that your data saver is on. Make sure that the background access is limited and that",
