      "turn_id": "turn-0095",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 566.47,
      "end_seconds": 579.01,
      "text": "No, yeah, thanks for that. I mean, I'm still annoyed about the $40 and just having this data spent overnight. But I'm glad at least we found the cause, right? And we turned it off. So yeah, thanks for that.",
      "word_count": 42,
